Package: powersync-plugin-skoda
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: PowerSync integration plugin for Škoda electric vehicles
 This package contains the nymea integration plugin that reads the charging
 state of a Škoda electric vehicle (state of charge, plug state, charging
 state) from the MyŠkoda public API, for use by the ETM PowerSync home energy
 management system. Read-only: the plugin sends no command to the vehicle.
 Each user enters the API key created in the MyŠkoda app for their vehicle.
